---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import CallToAction from '../components/CallToAction.astro';
import coverImage from '../assets/services/body-soul-spirit-cover.png';
import { organizationSchema, serviceSchema } from '../data/schema';
---
<BaseLayout title="Body Soul Spirit Reset Coaching | Threads Coaching" description="Faith-aware coaching that creates room for body, soul and spirit to be considered together." path="/body-soul-spirit-reset" schema={[organizationSchema, serviceSchema('Body Soul Spirit Reset coaching', '/body-soul-spirit-reset', 'Faith-aware coaching that creates room for body, soul and spirit to be considered together.')] }>
  <div class="container"><Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Body Soul Spirit Reset' }]} /></div><section class="hero-copy section"><div class="container split split--media"><div><p class="eyebrow">Identity, faith &amp; holistic coaching</p><h1>Pursue wholeness with God at the centre.</h1><p class="lead">For people who want to live from a deeper sense of identity and pursue wholeness across body, soul and spirit.</p><a class="button" href="/contact">Ask about Body Soul Spirit Reset</a></div><Image src={coverImage} alt="Body Soul Spirit Reset resource cover" width={640} densities={[1, 1.5]} sizes="(min-width: 64rem) 45vw, 100vw" quality={58} /></div></section>
  <section class="section section--tint"><div class="container narrow"><h2>Your body, soul and spirit were never meant to live in separate boxes.</h2><p>Faith, identity, feelings, relationships and everyday habits affect one another. This coaching route makes room to explore those connections rather than treating one part of life in isolation.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container narrow"><h2>Not simply the absence of struggle, but a deeper experience of shalom.</h2><p>Paul’s coaching grows out of his own journey of healing and breakthrough across body, mind and spirit. His pastoral, faith-filled approach can include powerful questions, inner-healing tools, prayer and practical goal setting.</p><ul><li>Explore identity and purpose.</li><li>Make room for discipleship and everyday faith.</li><li>Notice patterns of self-talk, belief and behaviour.</li><li>Choose practical goals towards greater wholeness.</li></ul><p>Coaching is not medical, clinical or therapeutic treatment. If you need specialist healthcare or mental-health support, seek an appropriately qualified professional.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section section--tint"><div class="container narrow"><p class="eyebrow">A free guide</p><h2>Interested in the Body Soul Spirit Reset resource?</h2><p>The guide is being prepared for direct download. Until it is available, please <a href="mailto:threadscoaching@gmail.com">email Threads Coaching</a> to ask about it.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container narrow"><h2>Start with the part of the story that feels most present.</h2><p>You do not need to have the right words or a complete plan. A conversation can help you decide whether this or <a href="/one-to-one-sessions">one-to-one coaching</a> is the more useful place to begin.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section section--tint"><div class="container narrow"><h2>A careful way to begin</h2><ol class="steps"><li><strong>Share what feels connected.</strong><span>Start with the pattern, question or pressure that feels most present.</span></li><li><strong>Explore your context.</strong><span>Make room for faith, identity, feelings and practical habits without forcing a quick answer.</span></li><li><strong>Choose a supported next step.</strong><span>Decide whether coaching is appropriate and what might help next.</span></li></ol><details><summary>Is this therapy or medical support?</summary><p>No. It is faith-aware coaching, not clinical, medical or therapeutic treatment.</p></details></div></section>
  <CallToAction title="Make room for a more integrated way forward." body="Tell us a little about what you are carrying." primaryHref="/contact" primaryLabel="Ask about Body Soul Spirit Reset" />
</BaseLayout>
